---
import MarketingLayout from '../../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/site';
---

<MarketingLayout title="About" description="About the PCBCraft project.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>About PCBCraft</h1>
      <p class="lede">PCBCraft is one native window for schematic, board layout, libraries and checks. Every edit goes through a typed engine command, and the desktop app, the command line and MCP call the same commands.</p>
      <p>It is a working foundation, not a finished production suite. The open items are tracked in the public roadmap.</p>
      <p data-slot="COPY #718">Placeholder for the project story and the people behind it. Final copy lands with #718.</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/tangency-labs/pcbcraft">Source code</a> · <a href="https://github.com/tangency-labs/pcbcraft/blob/main/ROADMAP.md">Roadmap</a> · <a href={url('license/')}>License</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }
</style>
